title: $:/plugins/rimir/kind-streams/changelog
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

|!Version |!Date |!Changes |
|0.0.4 |2026-10-29 |Row add-ons: the `stream-row-body` override now also transcludes every tiddler tagged `$:/tags/rimir/kind-streams/row-addon` at the start of each row (`currentTiddler` = the node), so other plugins can extend rows without a second override of the same shadow. Used by [[rimir/streams-ports|$:/plugins/rimir/streams-ports]]. |
|0.0.3 |2026-07-08 |''Kind type'' is now a native flyout submenu in the Streams context menu (styled like the Streams menu, ✓ marks the current type) instead of a modal dialog. Overrides `contextmenu-template` (priority 2) and adds `contextmenu-kind-submenu`; removed the modal + extension-slot item. |
|0.0.2 |2026-07-08 |Layout: node bar rendered above the node body; tightened spacing to match the pill-only view (zeroed field-bar + auto-`<p>` wrapper margins via `display:contents`); expanded tools laid out inline on the pill's row. |
|0.0.1 |2026-07-08 |Initial release: type pill on typed Streams nodes, lazy in-node field bar (reuses kind's stream-view), right-click ''Kind type…'' assign dialog (reuses kind's type-picker), enable toggle. Overrides `stream-row-body` via `plugin-priority: 2`. |
